  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed roof alterations, comprising the raised ridge, together with the side and rear dormers, would, by reason of their excessive size, bulk and siting and the absence of appropriate insets from the eaves, ridge and roof edges, fail to remain subordinate to the host roof. The proposal would therefore harm the character and appearance of the host dwelling and the surrounding area, contrary to Core Policy 30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010); Policies DMD 6, DMD 8, DMD 13 and DMD 37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014); Policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021); and Policy DP3 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026)."
